a bellboy, this game delivers an authentic VR hotel experience like never before.\n\n\ud83c\udfe8 Key Features:\n\nFully interactive hotel environment\n\nRealistic guest interactions and behaviors\n\nMultiple hotel service tasks (reception, room service, cleaning, delivery)\n\nGuest approval system \u2014 identify who\u2019s fit to stay\n\nImmersive sound design and natural VR controls\n\nTake your place behind the reception desk and show what it takes to keep a hotel running smoothly!", "short_description": "Be the bellboy in a luxury VR hotel!\nGreet guests, deliver luggage, clean rooms, and manage hotel operations in a fully interactive hospitality simulation."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://gametriclabs.com/privacy-policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "\u0130N\u0130T\u0130UM STUD\u0130O", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://gametriclabs.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "331529188132278"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["STANDING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "25186331180962715"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 11, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "4401666803430349"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1066729225825848"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1550191433161239"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "2368635823657931"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "969723922419393"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1230253588881662"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "14